# gw wraps a long task onto several lines instead of cutting it off with …, and gw again cuts it off.
size 40 12
file <<END
Packing:
	- Remember the universal power adapter and spare cables
END
see - Remember the universal power adap…
keys gw
see - Remember the universal power
see adapter and spare cables
keys <A-z>
see - Remember the universal power adap…
hide adapter and spare cables
quit
